message: "If you use this software, please cite the repository and the exact release."
title: "MICA bridge"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Frank
    family-names: Böhm
version: "0.1.0"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/arcencilo-family/mica-bridge"
date-released: "2026-11-16"
abstract: >-
  A pre-release code snapshot of MICA's bridge: the service that carries an AI
  agent's declared acts to the MICA machine's readers, and the declaration that sets
  what each reader is asked. It needs the matching mica-machine release. See the
  README for the known limits and the tests expected to fail.
keywords:
  - artificial intelligence
  - AI safety
  - agents
  - monitoring
  - evidence
